---
# The collection deliberately exposes a single, documented `k0s_*` variable
# namespace (see README "Notable variables"). Prefixing every variable with
# its role name (common_/controller_/loadbalancer_/worker_) would make the
# user-facing interface role-specific and break the documented names, so the
# var-naming[no-role-prefix] rule is disabled on purpose.
skip_list:
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
